# Keep the build context small. The Docker daemon used to build this fork is
# Node B's own, and its root disk is the estate's tightest resource.
#
# Conservative on purpose: `ui/` itself is NOT excluded, because upstream's
# bin/core/single-arch.Dockerfile builds the UI from source and needs it.
.git/
target/
**/node_modules/
docsite/
screenshots/
